    <!-- 점유/체크인 시각을 한국 시간으로 바꿀 때 쓰는 사이트 현지 타임존(Windows ID). -->
    <add key="SiteTimeZone.CMC" value="Arabian Standard Time" />
    <add key="SiteTimeZone.MNGHA" value="Arab Standard Time" />
    <add key="SiteTimeZone.RC" value="Arab Standard Time" />
    <add key="SiteTimeZone.AURORA" value="US Mountain Standard Time" />
    <!-- Auto-update: production default = public GitHub Releases static HTTPS (no PAT). -->
    <add key="Update.Enabled" value="true" />
    <add key="Update.SourceType" value="GitHubRelease" />
    <!-- Prefer owner/repo OR ReleaseBaseUrl. ManifestUrl overrides latest endpoint if set. -->
    <add key="Update.ReleaseOwner" value="Shunamo" />
    <add key="Update.ReleaseRepo" value="GBCWorkHub" />
    <add key="Update.ReleaseBaseUrl" value="" />
    <add key="Update.ManifestUrl" value="" />
    <!-- Offline/test only -->
    <add key="Update.ManifestPath" value="" />
